Election 2024 Analysis Dashboard

Project Overview

Developed an interactive Power BI dashboard to analyze 2024 election results across states, parties, constituencies, and candidates. The dashboard presents election data in a simple and interactive format to make comparison and analysis easier.

Tools Used

- Power BI
- DAX
- Power Query
- Excel

Key Analysis

The dashboard provides analysis of:

- Total seats and seats won
- Total votes and vote share
- State-wise election results
- Party-wise seat distribution
- Constituency performance
- Candidate performance
- Winning margins
- Regional voting trends

Dashboard Features

Interactive filters are provided for State, Party, Constituency, and Candidate, allowing users to explore the election results based on their requirements.

Key Insights

The dashboard helps identify top-performing parties, leading candidates, regional voting patterns, and winning margins across different constituencies.

